sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Backend
    participant Redis as Redis (OTP cache)
    participant Email as Email Service

    U->>FE: Submit email + password
    FE->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>API: verify Argon2 password hash
    API->>Redis: store 6-digit OTP (10min TTL)
    API->>Email: send OTP email
    API-->>FE: 200 {otp_required: true}
    Email-->>U: Email with OTP code

    U->>FE: Enter OTP code
    FE->>API: POST /api/auth/login/verify-otp
    API->>Redis: validate OTP
    Redis-->>API: valid
    API->>API: issue access (15min) + refresh (30d) JWTs
    API-->>FE: 200 tokens + Set-Cookie (httpOnly)
    FE-->>U: Redirect to dashboard
